PROVENANCE

The logos were generated with an AI image tool under the owner's direction, then
chosen and approved by the owner. The owner supplied them on 2026-10-08 (#397). The
files are kept byte for byte as supplied: `tests/test_brand_assets.py` checks each
one against its full SHA-256. Decision 0111 records their location, terms and
provenance.
